   Legacy optional audio-analysis modules include two quantized ONNX
   models. Active local AutoMix selection does not load these models:

   • beat_this_int8.onnx
     Derived from CPJKU/beat_this (https://github.com/CPJKU/beat_this)
     Copyright (c) CPJKU / Johannes Kepler University Linz
     License: MIT

   • vocals_umxhq_int8.onnx
     Derived from sigsep/open-unmix (https://github.com/sigsep/open-unmix)
     Copyright (c) Inria / SigSep
     License: MIT

   Upstream MIT notices are preserved in LICENSES/beat_this-MIT.txt
   and LICENSES/open-unmix-MIT.txt. Exact quantized-export provenance
   remains under review. Open-Unmix's umxl model has different,
   non-commercial terms; it must not be confused with umxhq above.

